#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:306
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If your system is crashing regularly and you are running out of disk space, "
"deleting old [.filename]#vmcore# files in [.filename]#/var/crash# could save "
"a considerable amount of disk space!"
msgstr "如果系统经常崩溃且磁盘空间不足，删除 [.filename]#/var/crash# 中旧的 [.filename]#vmcore# 文件可以释放大量磁盘空间！"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:309
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "On-Line Kernel Debugging Using DDB"
msgstr "使用 DDB 进行在线内核调试"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:313
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"While `kgdb` as an off-line debugger provides a very high level of user "
"interface, there are some things it cannot do.  The most important ones "
"being breakpointing and single-stepping kernel code."
msgstr "`kgdb` 作为离线调试器提供了非常完善的用户界面，但有些事情它无法完成。其中最重要的是设置断点和对内核代码进行单步执行。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:317
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you need to do low-level debugging on your kernel, there is an on-line "
"debugger available called DDB.  It allows setting of breakpoints, single-"
"stepping kernel functions, examining and changing kernel variables, etc.  "
"However, it cannot access kernel source files, and only has access to the "
"global and static symbols, not to the full debug information like `kgdb` "
"does."
msgstr "如果需要对内核进行底层调试，可以使用名为 DDB 的在线调试器。它允许设置断点、单步执行内核函数、检查和修改内核变量等。不过，它无法访问内核源文件，并且只能访问全局符号和静态符号，无法像 `kgdb` 那样访问完整的调试信息。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:319
#, fuzzy
msgid "To configure your kernel to include DDB, add the options"
msgstr "要配置内核以包含 DDB，请添加以下选项"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:322
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "options KDB\n"
msgstr "options KDB\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:327
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "options DDB\n"
msgstr "options DDB\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:331
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"to your config file, and rebuild.  (See extref:{handbook}[The FreeBSD "
"Handbook] for details on configuring the FreeBSD kernel)."
msgstr "到配置文件中，然后重新构建内核。（有关配置 FreeBSD 内核的详细信息，请参见 extref:{handbook}[FreeBSD 手册]。）"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:337
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once your DDB kernel is running, there are several ways to enter DDB.  The "
"first, and earliest way is to use the boot flag `-d`.  The kernel will start "
"up in debug mode and enter DDB prior to any device probing.  Hence you can "
"even debug the device probe/attach functions.  To use this, exit the "
"loader's boot menu and enter `boot -d` at the loader prompt."
msgstr "运行启用了 DDB 的内核后，有几种方式可以进入 DDB。最早的一种方式是使用启动标志 `-d`。内核将以调试模式启动，并在探测任何设备之前进入 DDB。因此，你甚至可以调试设备探测/附加函数。要使用此方式，请退出加载器的启动菜单，并在加载器提示符处输入 `boot -d`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:341
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The second scenario is to drop to the debugger once the system has booted.  "
"There are two simple ways to accomplish this.  If you would like to break to "
"the debugger from the command prompt, simply type the command:"
msgstr "第二种情况是在系统启动后进入调试器。有两种简单的方法可以做到这一点。如果你想从命令提示符进入调试器，只需输入以下命令："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:345
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# sysctl debug.kdb.enter=1\n"
msgstr "# sysctl debug.kdb.enter=1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:352
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Alternatively, if you are at the system console, you may use a hot-key on "
"the keyboard.  The default break-to-debugger sequence is kbd:[Ctrl+Alt"
"+ESC].  For syscons, this sequence can be remapped and some of the "
"distributed maps out there do this, so check to make sure you know the right "
"sequence to use.  There is an option available for serial consoles that "
"allows the use of a serial line BREAK on the console line to enter DDB "
"(`options BREAK_TO_DEBUGGER` in the kernel config file).  It is not the "
"default since there are a lot of serial adapters around that gratuitously "
"generate a BREAK condition, for example when pulling the cable."
msgstr "或者，如果你在系统控制台前，可以使用键盘快捷键。默认的进入调试器组合键是 kbd:[Ctrl+Alt+ESC]。对于 syscons，此组合键可以重新映射，而且一些随系统分发的映射表会这样做，因此请确认你知道应使用哪个组合键。串行控制台有一个可用选项，允许通过控制台线路上的串行 BREAK 信号进入 DDB（在内核配置文件中设置 `options BREAK_TO_DEBUGGER`）。默认情况下未启用此选项，因为许多串行适配器会无故产生 BREAK 信号，例如拔掉电缆时。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:355
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The third way is that any panic condition will branch to DDB if the kernel "
"is configured to use it.  For this reason, it is not wise to configure a "
"kernel with DDB for a machine running unattended."
msgstr "第三种方式是：如果内核配置为使用 DDB，任何 panic 情况都会转入 DDB。因此，对于无人值守运行的机器，不建议配置启用了 DDB 的内核。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:357
#, fuzzy
msgid "To obtain the unattended functionality, add:"
msgstr "要获得无人值守功能，请添加："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:361
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "options\tKDB_UNATTENDED\n"
msgstr "options\tKDB_UNATTENDED\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:364
#, fuzzy
msgid "to the kernel configuration file and rebuild/reinstall."
msgstr "将其添加到内核配置文件中，然后重新构建并安装内核。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:367
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The DDB commands roughly resemble some `gdb` commands.  The first thing you "
"probably need to do is to set a breakpoint:"
msgstr "DDB 命令与某些 `gdb` 命令大致相似。你可能首先需要设置一个断点："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:371
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid " break function-name address\n"
msgstr " break function-name address\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:376
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Numbers are taken hexadecimal by default, but to make them distinct from "
"symbol names; hexadecimal numbers starting with the letters `a-f` need to be "
"preceded with `0x` (this is optional for other numbers).  Simple expressions "
"are allowed, for example: `function-name + 0x103`."
msgstr "数字默认按十六进制处理，但为避免与符号名称混淆，以字母 `a-f` 开头的十六进制数需要加上 `0x` 前缀（其他数字可加可不加）。允许使用简单表达式，例如：`function-name + 0x103`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:378
#, fuzzy
msgid "To exit the debugger and continue execution, type:"
msgstr "要退出调试器并继续执行，请输入："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:382
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid " continue\n"
msgstr " continue\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:385
#, fuzzy
msgid "To get a stack trace of the current thread, use:"
msgstr "要获取当前线程的堆栈跟踪，请使用："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:389
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid " trace\n"
msgstr " trace\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:392
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To get a stack trace of an arbitrary thread, specify a process ID or thread "
"ID as a second argument to `trace`."
msgstr "要获取任意线程的堆栈跟踪，请将进程 ID 或线程 ID 作为第二个参数传给 `trace`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:394
#, fuzzy
msgid "If you want to remove a breakpoint, use"
msgstr "要移除断点，请使用"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:399
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
" del\n"
" del address-expression\n"
msgstr " del\n del address-expression\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:403
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The first form will be accepted immediately after a breakpoint hit, and "
"deletes the current breakpoint.  The second form can remove any breakpoint, "
"but you need to specify the exact address; this can be obtained from:"
msgstr "断点命中后，可以立即使用第一种形式删除当前断点。第二种形式可以移除任意断点，但需要指定确切地址；可通过以下命令获取该地址："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:407
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid " show b\n"
msgstr " show b\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:410
msgid "or:"
msgstr "或者:"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:414
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid " show break\n"
msgstr " show break\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:417
#, fuzzy
msgid "To single-step the kernel, try:"
msgstr "要对内核进行单步执行，请尝试："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:421
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid " s\n"
msgstr " s\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:424
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This will step into functions, but you can make DDB trace them until the "
"matching return statement is reached by:"
msgstr "这会进入函数内部；也可以让 DDB 跟踪函数，直到到达对应的返回语句："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:428
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid " n\n"
msgstr " n\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:434
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This is different from ``gdb``'s `next` statement; it is like ``gdb``'s "
"`finish`.  Pressing kbd:[n] more than once will cause a continue."
msgstr "这与 ``gdb`` 的 `next` 语句不同；它类似于 ``gdb`` 的 `finish`。多次按下 kbd:[n] 会导致继续执行。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:437
#, fuzzy
msgid "To examine data from memory, use (for example):"
msgstr "要检查内存中的数据，请使用（例如）："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:444
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
" x/wx 0xf0133fe0,40\n"
" x/hd db_symtab_space\n"
" x/bc termbuf,10\n"
" x/s stringbuf\n"
msgstr " x/wx 0xf0133fe0,40\n x/hd db_symtab_space\n x/bc termbuf,10\n x/s stringbuf\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:449
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"for word/halfword/byte access, and hexadecimal/decimal/character/ string "
"display.  The number after the comma is the object count.  To display the "
"next 0x10 items, simply use:"
msgstr "这些命令分别用于按字/半字/字节访问，并以十六进制/十进制/字符/字符串形式显示。逗号后的数字是对象数量。要显示接下来的 0x10 个项目，只需使用："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:453
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid " x ,10\n"
msgstr " x ,10\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:456
#, fuzzy
msgid "Similarly, use"
msgstr "类似地，使用"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:460
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid " x/ia foofunc,10\n"
msgstr " x/ia foofunc,10\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:463
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"to disassemble the first 0x10 instructions of `foofunc`, and display them "
"along with their offset from the beginning of `foofunc`."
msgstr "反汇编 `foofunc` 的前 0x10 条指令，并显示它们相对于 `foofunc` 起始位置的偏移量。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:465
#, fuzzy
msgid "To modify memory, use the write command:"
msgstr "要修改内存，请使用写入命令："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:470
