msgstr " show reg\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:483
#, fuzzy
msgid "Alternatively, you can display a single register value by e.g."
msgstr "或者，可以显示单个寄存器的值，例如："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:487
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid " p $eax\n"
msgstr " p $eax\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:490
#, fuzzy
msgid "and modify it by:"
msgstr "并通过以下命令修改它："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:494
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid " set $eax new-value\n"
msgstr " set $eax new-value\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:497
#, fuzzy
msgid "Should you need to call some kernel functions from DDB, simply say:"
msgstr "如果需要从 DDB 调用内核函数，只需输入："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:501
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid " call func(arg1, arg2, ...)\n"
msgstr " call func(arg1, arg2, ...)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:504
#, fuzzy
msgid "The return value will be printed."
msgstr "返回值将会显示出来。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:506
#, fuzzy
msgid "For a man:ps[1] style summary of all running processes, use:"
msgstr "要以 man:ps[1] 风格汇总所有正在运行的进程，请使用："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:510
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid " ps\n"
msgstr " ps\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:515
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Now you have examined why your kernel failed, and you wish to reboot.  "
"Remember that, depending on the severity of previous malfunctioning, not all "
"parts of the kernel might still be working as expected.  Perform one of the "
"following actions to shut down and reboot your system:"
msgstr "现在你已经检查了内核出错的原因，并准备重新启动。请记住，根据先前故障的严重程度，内核的某些部分可能已无法正常工作。请执行以下操作之一来关闭并重新启动系统："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:519
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid " panic\n"
msgstr " panic\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:522
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This will cause your kernel to dump core and reboot, so you can later "
"analyze the core on a higher level with man:kgdb[1]."
msgstr "这会使内核转储核心文件并重新启动，以便之后使用 man:kgdb[1] 从更高层次分析核心文件。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:526
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid " call boot(0)\n"
msgstr " call boot(0)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:530
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Might be a good way to cleanly shut down the running system, `sync()` all "
"disks, and finally, in some cases, reboot.  As long as the disk and "
"filesystem interfaces of the kernel are not damaged, this could be a good "
"way for an almost clean shutdown."
msgstr "这或许是正常关闭运行中系统的好方法：它会对所有磁盘执行 `sync()`，并且在某些情况下最终重新启动。只要内核的磁盘和文件系统接口未受损，这种方式就可以实现近乎正常的关机。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:534
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid " reset\n"
msgstr " reset\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:537
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This is the final way out of disaster and almost the same as hitting the Big "
"Red Button."
msgstr "这是灾难发生时的最后手段，几乎等同于按下那个巨大的红色按钮。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:539
#, fuzzy
msgid "If you need a short command summary, simply type:"
msgstr "如果需要简短的命令摘要，只需输入："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:543
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid " help\n"
msgstr " help\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:547
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It is highly recommended to have a printed copy of the man:ddb[4] manual "
"page ready for a debugging session.  Remember that it is hard to read the on-"
"line manual while single-stepping the kernel."
msgstr "强烈建议在调试会话开始前准备好 man:ddb[4] 手册页的打印副本。请记住，在对内核进行单步执行时，很难阅读在线手册。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:549
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "On-Line Kernel Debugging Using Remote GDB"
msgstr "使用远程 GDB 进行内核在线调试"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:552
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The FreeBSD kernel provides a second KDB backend for on-line debugging: man:"
"gdb[4]."
msgstr "FreeBSD 内核提供了第二种用于在线调试的 KDB 后端：man:gdb[4]。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:558
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"GDB has supported _remote debugging_ for a long time.  This is done using a "
"very simple protocol along a serial line.  Unlike the other debugging "
"methods described above, you will need two machines for doing this.  One is "
"the host providing the debugging environment, including all the sources, and "
"a copy of the kernel binary with all the symbols in it.  The other is the "
"target machine that runs a copy of the very same kernel (optionally stripped "
"of the debugging information)."
msgstr "GDB 长期以来一直支持__远程调试__。它通过串行线路使用一种非常简单的协议实现。与上文介绍的其他调试方法不同，这需要两台机器。一台是提供调试环境的主机，其中包括所有源代码以及一份包含全部符号的内核二进制文件。另一台是目标机，运行同一内核的副本（可以去除调试信息）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:560
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In order to use remote GDB, ensure that the following options are present in "
"your kernel configuration:"
msgstr "要使用远程 GDB，请确保内核配置中包含以下选项："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:565
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"makeoptions     DEBUG=-g\n"
"options         KDB\n"
"options         GDB\n"
msgstr "makeoptions     DEBUG=-g\noptions         KDB\noptions         GDB\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:568
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Note that the `GDB` option is turned off by default in `GENERIC` kernels on -"
"STABLE and -RELEASE branches, but enabled on -CURRENT."
msgstr "请注意，在 -STABLE 和 -RELEASE 分支的 `GENERIC` 内核中，`GDB` 选项默认关闭；而在 -CURRENT 中则默认启用。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:572
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once built, copy the kernel to the target machine, and boot it.  Connect the "
"serial line of the target machine that has \"flags 080\" set on its uart "
"device to any serial line of the debugging host.  See man:uart[4] for "
"information on how to set the flags on a uart device."
msgstr "构建完成后，将内核复制到目标机并启动。将目标机上设置了 \"flags 080\" 的 uart 设备所连接的串行线路接到调试主机的任意串行线路。有关如何设置 uart 设备标志的信息，请参阅 man:uart[4]。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:575
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The target machine must be made to enter the GDB backend, either due to a "
"panic or by taking a purposeful trap into the debugger.  Before doing this, "
"select the GDB debugger backend:"
msgstr "目标机必须进入 GDB 后端，这可以由内核 panic 触发，也可以通过有意触发陷阱进入调试器。在此之前，请选择 GDB 调试器后端："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:579
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# sysctl debug.kdb.current=gdb\n"
"debug.kdb.current: ddb -> gdb\n"
msgstr "# sysctl debug.kdb.current=gdb\ndebug.kdb.current: ddb -> gdb\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:586
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The supported backends can be listed by the `debug.kdb.available` sysctl.  "
"If the kernel configuration includes `options DDB`, then man:ddb[4] will be "
"selected by default.  If `gdb` does not appear in the list of available "
"backends, then the debug serial port may not have been configured correctly."
msgstr "可用的后端可以通过 `debug.kdb.available` sysctl 列出。如果内核配置包含 `options DDB`，则默认会选择 man:ddb[4]。如果可用后端列表中没有 `gdb`，则调试串行端口可能未正确配置。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:589
#, fuzzy
msgid "Then, force entry to the debugger:"
msgstr "然后，强制进入调试器："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:593
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# sysctl debug.kdb.enter=1\n"
"debug.kdb.enter: 0KDB: enter: sysctl debug.kdb.enter\n"
msgstr "# sysctl debug.kdb.enter=1\ndebug.kdb.enter: 0KDB: enter: sysctl debug.kdb.enter\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:597
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The target machine now awaits connection from a remote GDB client.  On the "
"debugging machine, go to the compile directory of the target kernel, and "
"start `gdb`:"
msgstr "此时目标机正在等待远程 GDB 客户端连接。在调试机上，进入目标内核的编译目录并启动 `gdb`："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:608
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# cd /usr/obj/usr/src/amd64.amd64/sys/GENERIC/\n"
"# kgdb kernel\n"
"GNU gdb (GDB) 10.2 [GDB v10.2 for FreeBSD]\n"
"Copyright (C) 2021 Free Software Foundation, Inc.\n"
"...\n"
"Reading symbols from kernel...\n"
"Reading symbols from /usr/obj/usr/src/amd64.amd64/sys/GENERIC/kernel.debug...\n"
"(kgdb)\n"
msgstr "# cd /usr/obj/usr/src/amd64.amd64/sys/GENERIC/\n# kgdb kernel\nGNU gdb (GDB) 10.2 [GDB v10.2 for FreeBSD]\nCopyright (C) 2021 Free Software Foundation, Inc.\n...\nReading symbols from kernel...\nReading symbols from /usr/obj/usr/src/amd64.amd64/sys/GENERIC/kernel.debug...\n(kgdb)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:611
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Initialize the remote debugging session (assuming the first serial port is "
"being used) by:"
msgstr "假设使用的是第一个串行端口，通过以下命令初始化远程调试会话："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:615
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "(kgdb) target remote /dev/cuau0\n"
msgstr "(kgdb) target remote /dev/cuau0\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:618
#, fuzzy
msgid "Your hosting GDB will now gain control over the target kernel:"
msgstr "现在，主机上的 GDB 将取得对目标内核的控制权："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:625
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Remote debugging using /dev/cuau0\n"
"kdb_enter (why=<optimized out>, msg=<optimized out>) at /usr/src/sys/kern/subr_kdb.c:506\n"
"506                     kdb_why = KDB_WHY_UNSET;\n"
"(kgdb)\n"
msgstr "Remote debugging using /dev/cuau0\nkdb_enter (why=<optimized out>, msg=<optimized out>) at /usr/src/sys/kern/subr_kdb.c:506\n506                     kdb_why = KDB_WHY_UNSET;\n(kgdb)\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:633
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Depending on the compiler used, some local variables may appear as "
"`<optimized out>`, preventing them from being inspected directly by `gdb`.  "
"If this causes problems while debugging, it is possible to build the kernel "
"at a decreased optimization level, which may improve the visibility of some "
"variables.  This can be done by passing `COPTFLAGS=-O1` to man:make[1].  "
"However, certain classes of kernel bugs may manifest differently (or not at "
"all) when the optimization level is changed."
msgstr "根据所用的编译器，某些局部变量可能会显示为 `<optimized out>`，导致无法通过 `gdb` 直接检查。如果这给调试带来问题，可以降低内核的优化级别进行构建，这可能会提高某些变量的可见性。可以将 `COPTFLAGS=-O1` 传给 man:make[1] 来实现。不过，某些类型的内核错误在优化级别改变后可能会以不同方式出现，甚至不再出现。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:637
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You can use this session almost as any other GDB session, including full "
"access to the source, running it in gud-mode inside an Emacs window (which "
"gives you an automatic source code display in another Emacs window), etc."
msgstr "你几乎可以像使用其他任何 GDB 会话一样使用此会话，包括完全访问源代码、在 Emacs 窗口中以 gud-mode 运行（这样会在另一个 Emacs 窗口中自动显示源代码）等。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:639
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Debugging a Console Driver"
msgstr "调试控制台驱动程序"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:645
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Since you need a console driver to run DDB on, things are more complicated "
"if the console driver itself is failing.  You might remember the use of a "
"serial console (either with modified boot blocks, or by specifying `-h` at "
"the `Boot:` prompt), and hook up a standard terminal onto your first serial "
"port.  DDB works on any configured console driver, including a serial "
"console."
msgstr "由于运行 DDB 需要控制台驱动程序，如果控制台驱动程序本身发生故障，情况就会更复杂。你可能还记得使用串行控制台的方法（通过修改引导块，或在 `Boot:` 提示符处指定 `-h`），并将标准终端连接到第一个串行端口。DDB 可用于任何已配置的控制台驱动程序，包括串行控制台。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:647
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Debugging Deadlocks"
msgstr "调试死锁"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:652
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You may experience so called deadlocks, a situation where a system stops "
"doing useful work.  To provide a helpful bug report in this situation, use "
"man:ddb[4] as described in the previous section.  Include the output of `ps` "
"and `trace` for suspected processes in the report."
msgstr "你可能会遇到所谓的死锁，即系统停止执行有用工作的情况。要在这种情况下提供有帮助的错误报告，请按照上一节所述使用 man:ddb[4]。在报告中附上 `ps` 的输出，以及疑似相关进程的 `trace` 输出。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:656
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If possible, consider doing further investigation.  The recipe below is "
"especially useful if you suspect that a deadlock occurs in the VFS layer.  "
"Add these options to the kernel configuration file."
msgstr "如果可能，请考虑进一步调查。如果怀疑死锁发生在 VFS 层，下面的方法尤其有用。将这些选项添加到内核配置文件中。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:667
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"makeoptions \tDEBUG=-g\n"
"options \tINVARIANTS\n"
"options \tINVARIANT_SUPPORT\n"
"options \tWITNESS\n"
"options \tWITNESS_SKIPSPIN\n"
"options \tDEBUG_LOCKS\n"
"options \tDEBUG_VFS_LOCKS\n"
"options \tDIAGNOSTIC\n"
msgstr "makeoptions \tDEBUG=-g\noptions \tINVARIANTS\noptions \tINVARIANT_SUPPORT\noptions \tWITNESS\noptions \tWITNESS_SKIPSPIN\noptions \tDEBUG_LOCKS\noptions \tDEBUG_VFS_LOCKS\noptions \tDIAGNOSTIC\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:670
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When a deadlock occurs, in addition to the output of the `ps` command, "
"provide information from the `show pcpu`, `show allpcpu`, `show locks`, "
"`show alllocks`, `show lockedvnods` and `alltrace`."
msgstr "发生死锁时，除了 `ps` 命令的输出外，还请提供 `show pcpu`、`show allpcpu`、`show locks`、`show alllocks`、`show lockedvnods` 和 `alltrace` 的信息。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:672
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To obtain meaningful backtraces for threaded processes, use `thread thread-"
"id` to switch to the thread stack, and do a backtrace with `where`."
msgstr "要获取线程化进程有意义的回溯，请使用 `thread thread-id` 切换到该线程的堆栈，然后用 `where` 进行回溯。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:674
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Kernel debugging with Dcons"
msgstr "使用 Dcons 调试内核"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:680
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"man:dcons[4] is a very simple console driver that is not directly connected "
"with any physical devices.  It just reads and writes characters from and to "
"a buffer in a kernel or loader.  Due to its simple nature, it is very useful "
"for kernel debugging, especially with a FireWire(R) device.  Currently, "
"FreeBSD provides two ways to interact with the buffer from outside of the "
"kernel using man:dconschat[8]."
msgstr "man:dcons[4] 是一种非常简单的控制台驱动程序，不直接连接任何物理设备。它只是在内核或加载器中的缓冲区读写字符。由于结构简单，它非常适合用于内核调试，尤其是配合 FireWire(R) 设备使用。目前，FreeBSD 提供两种方式，可通过 man:dconschat[8] 从内核外部与该缓冲区交互。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:681
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Dcons over FireWire(R)"
msgstr "通过 FireWire(R) 使用 Dcons"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:689
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Most FireWire(R) (IEEE1394) host controllers are based on the OHCI "
"specification that supports physical access to the host memory.  This means "
"that once the host controller is initialized, we can access the host memory "
"without the help of software (kernel).  We can exploit this facility for "
"interaction with man:dcons[4].  man:dcons[4] provides similar functionality "
"as a serial console.  It emulates two serial ports, one for the console and "
"DDB, the other for GDB.  Since remote memory access is fully handled by the "
"hardware, the man:dcons[4] buffer is accessible even when the system crashes."
msgstr "大多数 FireWire(R)（IEEE1394）主机控制器基于 OHCI 规范，支持对主机内存进行物理访问。这意味着主机控制器初始化后，无需软件（内核）协助即可访问主机内存。我们可以利用这一功能与 man:dcons[4] 交互。man:dcons[4] 提供与串行控制台类似的功能。它模拟两个串行端口：一个用于控制台和 DDB，另一个用于 GDB。由于远程内存访问完全由硬件处理，即使系统崩溃，man:dcons[4] 缓冲区仍可访问。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:692
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"FireWire(R) devices are not limited to those integrated into motherboards.  "
"PCI cards exist for desktops, and a cardbus interface can be purchased for "
"laptops."
msgstr "FireWire(R) 设备并不限于主板集成设备。台式机可使用 PCI 卡，笔记本电脑则可购买 CardBus 接口卡。"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:693
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Enabling FireWire(R) and Dcons support on the target machine"
msgstr "在目标机器上启用 FireWire(R) 和 Dcons 支持"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:696
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To enable FireWire(R) and Dcons support in the kernel of the _target "
"machine_:"
msgstr "要在__目标机器__的内核中启用 FireWire(R) 和 Dcons 支持："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:698
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Make sure your kernel supports `dcons`, `dcons_crom` and `firewire`. `Dcons` "
"should be statically linked with the kernel. For `dcons_crom` and "
"`firewire`, modules should be OK."
msgstr "确保内核支持 `dcons`、`dcons_crom` 和 `firewire`。`Dcons` 应静态链接到内核中。`dcons_crom` 和 `firewire` 使用模块即可。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:699
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Make sure physical DMA is enabled. You may need to add `hw.firewire."
"phydma_enable=1` to [.filename]#/boot/loader.conf#."
msgstr "确保已启用物理 DMA。可能需要将 `hw.firewire.phydma_enable=1` 添加到 [.filename]#/boot/loader.conf#。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:700
#, fuzzy
msgid "Add options for debugging."
msgstr "添加调试选项。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:701
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Add `dcons_gdb=1` in [.filename]#/boot/loader.conf# if you use GDB over "
"FireWire(R)."
msgstr "如果要通过 FireWire(R) 使用 GDB，请在 [.filename]#/boot/loader.conf# 中添加 `dcons_gdb=1`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:702
#, fuzzy
msgid "Enable `dcons` in [.filename]#/etc/ttys#."
msgstr "在 [.filename]#/etc/ttys# 中启用 `dcons`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:703
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Optionally, to force `dcons` to be the high-level console, add `hw.firewire."
"dcons_crom.force_console=1` to [.filename]#loader.conf#."
msgstr "还可以将 `hw.firewire.dcons_crom.force_console=1` 添加到 [.filename]#loader.conf#，强制将 `dcons` 设为高级控制台。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:705
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To enable FireWire(R) and Dcons support in man:loader[8] on i386 or amd64:"
msgstr "要在 i386 或 amd64 上的 man:loader[8] 中启用 FireWire(R) 和 Dcons 支持："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:707
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Add `LOADER_FIREWIRE_SUPPORT=YES` in [.filename]#/etc/make.conf# and rebuild "
"man:loader[8]:"
msgstr "在 [.filename]#/etc/make.conf# 中添加 `LOADER_FIREWIRE_SUPPORT=YES`，然后重新构建 man:loader[8]："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:711
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# cd /sys/boot/i386 && make clean && make && make install\n"
msgstr "# cd /sys/boot/i386 && make clean && make && make install\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/developers-handbook/kerneldebug/_index.adoc:714
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To enable man:dcons[4] as an active low-level console, add `boot_multicons="
